  blues off the exotic Seychelles Islands\, the other to chronicle whale fa
 milies in Mexico’s stunning Gulf of California—the film is an inspirat
 ional story that transforms our understanding of the largest animal ever t
 o have lived.\n\n𝗣𝘂𝗯𝗹𝗶𝗰 : 3.7\n\n\nAffiche : https://ima
